---
// AI Agent demo - conversational terminal
---
<section class="relative bg-slate-900 text-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(2,106,191,0.12) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20 relative">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <span class="chip chip-coral mb-4">⚡ Démo en temps réel</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">
          Voici à quoi ressemble un <span class="text-brand-400">agent IA</span> en production.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Pas une démo PowerPoint. Un vrai agent, branché sur votre CRM et votre catalogue, qui qualifie vos leads et répond à vos clients.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>Disponible 24/7</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>Multilingue par défaut</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>Apprend de vos retours</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>~0,01 €/conversation</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-coral">Tester sur mon activité</a>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-brand-900/30">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 border-b border-white/10 bg-slate-900">
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-coral-500"></span>
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            <span class="ml-3 text-slate-400 text-xs font-mono">agent-commercial.wpsolution.pro</span>
            <span class="ml-auto text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>En ligne
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 space-y-3 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0">[09:14]</span><span class="text-slate-400">visiteur:</span><span class="text-slate-100">Bonjour, je cherche un site web pour ma société d'avocats.</span></div>
            <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0">[09:14]</span><span class="text-brand-400">agent:</span><span class="text-slate-100">Bonjour ! Pour mieux vous orienter : nombre d'avocats ? Souhaitez-vous la prise de RDV en ligne ?</span></div>
            <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0">[09:15]</span><span class="text-slate-400">visiteur:</span><span class="text-slate-100">Cabinet de 4 associés, oui pour le RDV.</span></div>
            <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0">[09:15]</span><span class="text-brand-400">agent:</span><span class="text-slate-100">Parfait. Fourchette estimée : <span class="text-brand-300 font-bold">3 500 – 5 500 €</span>. Souhaitez-vous un appel avec un expert ?</span></div>
            <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0">[09:16]</span><span class="text-slate-400">visiteur:</span><span class="text-slate-100">Oui, jeudi 14h30.</span></div>
            <div class="flex gap-3 bg-emerald-500/10 -mx-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30">
              <span class="text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0">[09:16]</span><span class="text-emerald-400">agent:</span><span class="text-slate-100">✓ RDV confirmé. <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">Lead qualifié envoyé au CRM (score 87/100).</span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-3 pt-1"><span class="text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0">[09:17]</span><span class="text-slate-400">visiteur:</span><span class="text-slate-100 cursor-blink">Merci !&nbsp;</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 border-t border-white/10 divide-x divide-white/10 bg-slate-900/60 text-center">
            <div class="p-3"><div class="font-display text-xl text-brand-300">3min</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-0.5">Lead qualifié</div></div>
            <div class="p-3"><div class="font-display text-xl text-coral-400">0,008€</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-0.5">Coût conv.</div></div>
            <div class="p-3"><div class="font-display text-xl text-emerald-400">87%</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-0.5">Précision</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
